---
const stages = [
  {
    num: '01',
    title: 'Medical detox',
    detail: 'If you\'re still physically dependent, you start here. Withdrawal from alcohol, opioids, and benzodiazepines can be dangerous without supervision — so this isn\'t a hurdle, it\'s a safety measure. Typically four to seven days with 24/7 nursing and physician oversight.',
  },
  {
    num: '02',
    title: 'Stabilization',
    detail: 'Your medical team confirms your body is stable and ready for the deeper therapeutic work. Your case manager is already involved, so nothing about you has to be re-explained to a new team.',
  },
  {
    num: '03',
    title: 'Step down into residential',
    detail: 'You move into the residential program — upgraded accommodations, full therapeutic schedule, phone access in the evenings. Same building, same people, no second admission process.',
  },
  {
    num: '04',
    title: 'Planning what comes next',
    detail: 'Residential is a beginning, not an ending. Your case manager builds a step-down plan with you so you leave with support and a direction, not just a discharge date.',
  },
];
---
<section
  id="pathway"
  class="relative bg-navy-deep text-white py-[50px] overflow-hidden"
  style="background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0,43,92,0.88) 50%, rgba(0,43,92,0.55) 100%), url('/Asset/stock%20photo/Desktop%20Dimensions/CTA.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"
>
  <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-gold"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-[25px] sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
      <p class="text-gold font-body text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-6 h-px bg-gold inline-block"></span>
        The Pathway
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-display mb-6">
        From detox into residential — without starting over
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body text-white/80 text-[17px] leading-[29px]">
        For most people, residential is a step down from medical detox. Both happen here, so there's no scrambling to find a second facility and no repeating your story to a whole new team.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      {stages.map(stage => (
        <div class="bg-white/8 border border-white/12 rounded-xl p-7 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <div class="font-display text-4xl text-gold mb-4">{stage.num}</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-white mb-3">{stage.title}</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-white/70 text-[16px] leading-[26px]">{stage.detail}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 border-l-2 border-gold/40 pl-6 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-body text-white/85 text-[17px] leading-[29px]">
        <strong class="text-white font-bold">Not everyone needs detox first.</strong> Depending on the substance and how recently you used, a clinical assessment may determine you can begin at the residential level — methamphetamine, for instance, often doesn't require a traditional medical detox because the withdrawal profile is different. That's exactly what the phone assessment and provider review are for: placing you safely at the right starting point.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
